-2-2013:p0835:b003:l027","ordinal":250829,"en":"Chamaa was tired and left"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l028","ordinal":250830,"en":"Dust feet is a big problem."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l029","ordinal":250831,"en":"If it moves, it's from the air"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l030","ordinal":250832,"en":"He left the dream."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l031","ordinal":250833,"en":"Encountering a rabid dog"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l032","ordinal":250834,"en":"Your air has flown like a sly road.\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l033","ordinal":250835,"en":"Saying, like that, Semetey,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l034","ordinal":250836,"en":"The charmed horse shook,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l035","ordinal":250837,"en":"A hailstone split from the shell,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l036","ordinal":250838,"en":"If you look at the spilled bullet"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l037","ordinal":250839,"en":"It looks exactly like home."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l038","ordinal":250840,"en":"\"The dusty dustman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b003:l039","ordinal":250841,"en":"It looked bad."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l001","ordinal":250842,"en":"It was a gift, it was a song,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l002","ordinal":250843,"en":"Encountering soul killer"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l003","ordinal":250844,"en":"This guy is a complete man."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l004","ordinal":250845,"en":"I faced such a problem."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l005","ordinal":250846,"en":"During the day, it is cloudy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l006","ordinal":250847,"en":"One day the sun broke."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l007","ordinal":250848,"en":"It's getting stronger Dusty foot,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l008","ordinal":250849,"en":"Stand at the base of the flag."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l009","ordinal":250850,"en":"The air you built is for me,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l010","ordinal":250851,"en":"Built for the Kyrgyz people"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l011","ordinal":250852,"en":"Keep fighting!\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l012","ordinal":250853,"en":"So, and so, Semetey"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l013","ordinal":250854,"en":"Meder did it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l014","ordinal":250855,"en":"He came in and turned around."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l015","ordinal":250856,"en":"Our grandfather Bakay is an old man"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l016","ordinal":250857,"en":"This is from Changyayak Kafir"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l017","ordinal":250858,"en":"He lost his son in Baitailak."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l018","ordinal":250859,"en":"If angry, Dusty"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l019","ordinal":250860,"en":"If I look, I will reach the bottom."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l020","ordinal":250861,"en":"A little bit of this country"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l021","ordinal":250862,"en":"It will kill without leaving it.\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l022","ordinal":250863,"en":"So, and so, Semetey"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l023","ordinal":250864,"en":"His eyes were like fire,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l024","ordinal":250865,"en":"He took a blood drink."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l025","ordinal":250866,"en":"From generation to generation"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l026","ordinal":250867,"en":"A statue that does not fear death,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l027","ordinal":250868,"en":"A man built by Aryslan."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l028","ordinal":250869,"en":"Courage to Choro:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l029","ordinal":250870,"en":"\"Dear Bakai old man,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l030","ordinal":250871,"en":"It's difficult, Dusty"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l031","ordinal":250872,"en":"The carnage does not seem to have touched"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l032","ordinal":250873,"en":"All of us are Kyrgyz."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l033","ordinal":250874,"en":"Raised and roared,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l034","ordinal":250875,"en":"The earth burst into laughter,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l035","ordinal":250876,"en":"Let's have enough carnage."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l036","ordinal":250877,"en":"Destroyed"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l037","ordinal":250878,"en":"Let's kill."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l038","ordinal":250879,"en":"May Aiza be broken and bound,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0835:b005:l039","ordinal":250880,"en":"Let the man die, let the mountain be"}]
